{
  "rule": "pim-activation",
  "about": "PIM activation completed (PIM for Groups and PIM for roles). Activity strings: Learn 'Microsoft Entra audit log activity reference', PIM section (GroupManagement 'Add member to role completed (PIM activation)', '... requested (PIM activation)'). Since 2026-11-07 (review findings B5, B6) the Severity column decides: Tier 0 (group object id first, then names) Medium, High off-hours or from a new IP; others Informational, Low when unusual. Cases pin working hours with the WorkHoursLocal / WorkDaysLocal placeholders so the result never depends on the clock.",
